<div class="comp door5" id="l6-door" style="left:830px;top:520px;width:118px;height:320px;"><div class="door-x" style="color:#55565f">&#8212;</div><div class="door-l">WORLD</div></div>
<div class="comp" id="l6-state" style="left:0;width:1080px;text-align:center;top:1096px;"><div style="font-size:40px;font-weight:bold;color:#e9e5da">it guides the model&#8217;s hand —</div><div style="font-size:40px;font-weight:bold;color:#e9e5da;margin-top:8px">touches nothing itself</div></div>
<div class="comp imgwrap" id="l7-sphere" style="left:110px;top:580px;width:430px;"><svg width="430" height="220" viewBox="0 0 430 220"><g transform="translate(0,18) scale(0.71)"><circle cx="130" cy="130" r="110" fill="none" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="6"/><ellipse cx="130" cy="130" rx="110" ry="42" fill="none" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="4" opacity=".75"/><ellipse cx="130" cy="130" rx="42" ry="110" fill="none" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="4" opacity=".75"/></g><path d="M196 110 L424 110" stroke="#ffb040" stroke-width="7"/></svg></div>
<div class="comp" id="l7-gate" style="left:472px;top:470px;width:236px;text-align:center;"><div class="gatebox"><svg width="110" height="150" viewBox="0 0 110 150"><path d="M25 62 L25 40 A30 30 0 0 1 85 40 L85 62" fill="none" stroke="#e9e5da" stroke-width="8"/><rect x="14" y="62" width="82" height="72" rx="10" fill="none" stroke="#e9e5da" stroke-width="7"/><circle cx="55" cy="92" r="10" fill="#e9e5da"/><path d="M55 92 L55 116" stroke="#e9e5da" stroke-width="8"/></svg></div><div style="font-size:33px;font-weight:bold;color:#e9e5da;margin-top:16px;letter-spacing:1px">PERMISSION</div></div>
<div class="comp imgwrap" id="l7-beyond" style="left:724px;top:672px;width:236px;"><svg width="236" height="36" viewBox="0 0 236 36"><path d="M4 18 L84 18 M104 18 L168 18 M188 18 L232 18" stroke="#55565f" stroke-width="7"/></svg></div>
<div class="comp" id="l7-toolq" style="left:756px;top:462px;border:3px dashed #96969f;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 20px;font-size:36px;font-weight:bold;color:#96969f;">tool?</div>
<div class="comp" id="l7-state" style="left:0;width:1080px;text-align:center;top:1131px;font-size:38px;color:#96969f;font-weight:bold;">no tool handed over — no action</div>
<div class="comp" id="l7-bubbles" style="left:118px;top:872px;width:220px;"><span class="bub"></span><span class="bub" style="width:64px"></span><span class="bub" style="width:44px"></span></div>
<div class="comp emailwin" id="l8-window" style="left:190px;top:470px;width:700px;height:560px;"><div class="ew-h">TO: YOU</div><div class="ew-l" style="width:88%"></div><div class="ew-l" style="width:95%"></div><div class="ew-l" style="width:70%"></div><div class="ew-l" style="width:82%"></div><span class="sendbtn-full">SEND</span></div>
<div class="comp imgwrap" id="l8-plane" style="left:770px;top:492px;width:170px;"><svg width="170" height="150" viewBox="0 0 170 150"><path d="M8 128 Q60 118 96 74" fill="none" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="5" stroke-dasharray="1 11" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M162 8 L96 44 L122 66 L132 34 Z" fill="#5eead4"/><path d="M122 66 L162 8 L104 84 L118 98 L128 74" fill="none" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
<div class="comp" id="l8-tag" style="left:0;width:1080px;text-align:center;top:1108px;"><span class="pill5">A TOOL ACTED</span></div>
<div class="comp" id="l9-words" style="left:140px;top:600px;width:220px;height:220px;border:4px solid #e9e5da;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;"><div style="font-size:46px;font-weight:bold;color:#e9e5da;margin-top:82px">words</div></div>
<div class="comp" id="l9-arrow" style="left:404px;top:636px;width:250px;text-align:center;"><div style="font-size:36px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffb040;letter-spacing:2px">TOOL</div><svg width="250" height="60" viewBox="0 0 250 60" style="margin-top:8px"><path d="M6 30 L204 30" stroke="#ffb040" stroke-width="9"/><path d="M182 6 L216 30 L182 54" fill="none" stroke="#ffb040" stroke-width="9"/></svg></div>
<div class="comp imgwrap" id="l9-door" style="left:688px;top:520px;width:270px;"><svg width="270" height="430" viewBox="0 0 270 430"><path d="M28 414 L28 16 L242 16 L242 414" fill="none" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="7"/><path d="M52 392 L52 44 L150 44 L196 392 Z" fill="rgba(94,234,212,.08)" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="6"/><circle cx="168" cy="220" r="9" fill="#5eead4"/></svg></div>
<div class="comp" id="l9-line" style="left:0;width:1080px;text-align:center;top:1097px;font-size:46px;color:#5eead4;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1px;">ACTION, IN THE REAL WORLD</div>
<div class="comp" id="b-next" style="left:0;width:1080px;text-align:center;top:538px;font-size:44px;color:#ffb040;font-weight:bold;">NEXT</div>
<div class="comp" id="b-line" style="left:0;width:1080px;text-align:center;top:677px;font-size:46px;color:#e9e5da;font-weight:bold;">Who hands the model its tools?</div>
<div class="comp imgwrap" id="b-ring" style="left:410px;top:800px;width:260px;"><svg width="260" height="260" viewBox="0 0 260 260"><circle cx="130" cy="130" r="112" fill="none" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="10 11"/><g transform="translate(62,62) scale(0.52)"><circle cx="130" cy="130" r="110" fill="none" stroke="#ffb040" stroke-width="7"/><ellipse cx="130" cy="130" rx="110" ry="42" fill="none" stroke="#ffb040" stroke-width="5" opacity=".75"/><ellipse cx="130" cy="130" rx="42" ry="110" fill="none" stroke="#ffb040" stroke-width="5" opacity=".75"/></g></svg></div>
<div class="comp" id="b-dir" style="left:0;width:1080px;text-align:center;top:1186px;font-size:48px;color:#5eead4;font-weight:bold;">THE HARNESS — LESSONS</div>
<div class="comp" id="b-tap" style="left:0;width:1080px;text-align:center;top:1282px;font-size:36px;color:#96969f;">tap to watch →</div>
</div>
<div id="tooltip"></div>
<div id="chrome">
  <button id="playbtn">▶ Play</button>
  <div id="bar"><div id="fill"></div></div>
  <span id="clock">0.0 / 44.8</span>
  <button id="ctxbtn">Production context</button>
</div>
<div id="ctxpanel"></div>
<audio id="mix" preload="auto" src="data:audio/mpeg;base64,